Portions of this package are adapted from TradingAgents by Tauric Research
(https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(see LICENSE-TradingAgents).

- rating.py: copied verbatim from tradingagents/agents/rating.py (header comment added).
- agents.py / sources.py: re-implemented in a lightweight form around the ideas of the original
  (bull/bear debate, risk committee, portfolio manager, structured ratings, decision memory with
  reflection, price grounding, portfolio context, StockTwits/Reddit/Polymarket/FRED sources).
No LangChain/LangGraph code is included. The LLM remains Google Gemini via its REST API.
